Alembic migration environment for the ServiceDesk API.

The database URL is not stored in alembic.ini. It is read at runtime from the
DATABASE_URL environment variable through app.config.settings, so the same
migration scripts run unchanged against a local container, docker compose and
the Kubernetes deployment.

Usage from the backend/ directory:

    alembic upgrade head        apply every pending migration
    alembic current             show the revision the database is stamped with
    alembic history --verbose   list the revision chain
    alembic downgrade base      roll every migration back
